==Battleground==
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**4 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Be sure to bring anti-Darks to this stage, as you will need them to chip down [[Director Kurosawah|Kurosawah]] and get rid of the [[Doge Dark]]s. [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] or another [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] will help against the [[Kory|Kories]], but traitless damagers like EPICFEST exclusive units should do fine to keep it at bay. Don't bother to bring shield piercers, as [[Aku Doge]] is the only one with a shield in the level. Just bring your anti-Dark, Aku, Traitless, and wave units and this stage should not be a big problem.

